pkg:Evidence_v1_30_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.30.0 (STORY-15 closed; BRSF v1.68.0 governance upgrade disclosed)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR (this package's own real, verified work): user uploaded a real session log with two distinct failures -- a package-name typo the existing remedy already named correctly but the model still missed on retry, and a token-budget truncation whose one automatic retry made the same problem worse by appending more explanation. Both root-caused from the real code and fixed generically: a real Levenshtein-based near-miss hint against the actual allowed-package set (not a hardcoded pairing), and a structured retryGenConfig mechanism letting a failing check request a genuinely larger output budget for its own retry, generically merged by withOneAutoFix with no per-case branching. Verified via real Playwright, including exact reproduction of the logged typo through the real pipeline. Pipeline order and Stage1-3 gates unaffected and re-verified PASS. Version bumped correctly before committing: all 4 stages moved to v1_10_0, Cross.D verified. SEPARATE, HONEST DISCLOSURE: pulling the Ontologies repo (required B5) brought in backlog_tbox_v1_68_0, a real, documented MAJOR change removing conformance-level suppression entirely -- all four facets now unconditionally required for every lineage. Re-running the also-renamed validator against this otherwise-unchanged register surfaces 198 real violations under the new standard -- not caused by this session's edits, a genuine gap against the current framework version. Not fixed in this pass; disclosed as real, substantial, separate follow-up work rather than rushed or silently absorbed."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "3037a0465aeed3579eb1107fc3e50d859927b6eabf6cd1468f362489183b53fb"^^xsd:string .
